# Nothing above this line protects the private work, and as of 2026-08-12 the
# structural protection this file used to claim does not exist: there is one
# repository and its root is one level up, at /var/www/html/themeaves, with no
# .gitignore of its own. So ../_dev, ../docs, ../design, ../shots and ../brand
# ARE inside the repo and can be staged. See the warning at the end of
# README.md for the two ways to fix that. Until then it is discipline, not
# structure.
